{"key":"practice/1880s","entities":[{"id":"practice.shanghai-wage","type":"practice","labels":{"zh-Hans":"上海工人的工资与物价"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1889","end":"1937","precision":"year"},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"二十世纪二三十年代上海工人的收入与物价：纱厂男工日工资 1920 年 0.9 元、1922 年 1.08 元，女工同期 0.45 元至 0.63 元；1930 年复旦调查的 54,000 名人力车夫平均月入约 10 元。米价 1889 年每百斤 1.93 元、1929 年每石 19 元；伙食占工人家庭开支一半以上（1922 年 63.1%、1930 年 53.2%）。按此，一个纱厂男工一个月的工钱大约能买一石多到两石米，车夫则更少。"},"tags":["常态","物价","城市日常"],"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.上海工人生活费"},{"ref":"source.web.上海工资"},{"ref":"source.web.民国收入米价"}],"metrics":[{"key":"male-wage-daily","name":{"zh-Hans":"纱厂男工日工资"},"unit":"元/日","points":[{"year":1920,"value":0.9},{"year":1921,"value":0.95},{"year":1922,"value":1.08}]},{"key":"female-wage-daily","name":{"zh-Hans":"纱厂女工日工资"},"unit":"元/日","points":[{"year":1920,"value":0.45},{"year":1921,"value":0.51},{"year":1922,"value":0.63}]},{"key":"rickshaw-income-monthly","name":{"zh-Hans":"人力车夫月收入"},"unit":"元/月","points":[{"year":1930,"value":10,"note":{"zh-Hans":"复旦大学对 54,000 名车夫的调查平均"}}]},{"key":"rice-per-shi","name":{"zh-Hans":"米价（每石）"},"unit":"元/石","points":[{"year":1929,"value":19}]},{"key":"rice-per-100jin","name":{"zh-Hans":"米价（每百斤）"},"unit":"元/百斤","points":[{"year":1889,"value":1.93},{"year":1907,"value":8.08}]},{"key":"food-share","name":{"zh-Hans":"伙食占家庭开支"},"unit":"%","points":[{"year":1922,"value":63.1},{"year":1925,"value":64.6},{"year":1930,"value":53.2}]}]}]}